    "legacyHtml": "<h3>Predavanje 2</h3> <p class=\"kurss-lesson-intro\">Drugo predavanje: dijalozi, riječi, izgovor, gramatika i prijevod.</p> <details class=\"lesson1-accordion\" open> <summary><span class=\"lesson1-number lesson1-number-red\">1.</span><span>Dijalozi/rečenice</span><span class=\"lesson1-chevron\">⌃</span></summary> <div class=\"lesson1-content\"> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Spielst du?<br>Nein, ich spiele nicht, ich arbeite.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Paul fragt nicht, er arbeitt.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Arbeitest du?<br>Nein, ich arbeite nicht, ich singe.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Was tut Paul?<br>Er spielt.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Was tut Marie?<br>Sie singt.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Paul spielt, aber Marie singt.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Singt ihr?<br>Nein, wir singen nicht, wir arbeiten.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Was tun Paul und Marie?<br>Sie fragen.<br>Sie antworten nicht.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Wer arbeitt?<br>Wir arbeiten.<br>Wir rechnen und zeichnen.</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Sie kommen, sie fragen, sie antworten, sie arbeiten, sie spielen, sie singen, sie gehen.</div> </div> </div> </details> <details class=\"lesson1-accordion\"> <summary><span class=\"lesson1-number lesson1-number-green\">2.</span><span>Riječi</span><span class=\"lesson1-chevron\">⌄</span></summary> <div class=\"lesson1-content\"> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Spielen - igrati • Igrati</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Nein - ne</div> <div class=\"course-example\">nicht - ne</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Arbeiten - raditi</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Fragen - pitati</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Šta radiš - šta radiš?</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Šta mislite - šta su uradili?</div> <div class=\"course-example\">aber - ali</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Odgovor - 电影</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Rechnen - izračunaj</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Zeichnen - crtati</div> <div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Marie</div> </div> </div> </details> <details class=\"lesson1-accordion\"> <summary><span class=\"lesson1-number lesson1-number-purple\">3.</span><span>Izgovor</span><span class=\"lesson1-chevron\">⌄</span></summary> <div class=\"lesson1-content\"> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">U riječima ich, nicht, rechnen, zeichnen, glas ch se izgovara se tiho, kao i u latvijskim riječima: technika, Fridrich.</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">U riječima diphonhzen proouncen arbeiten se izgovaraju riječi diphon afridrich. otprilike kao latvijski ravni zvuk e iza kojg služi i.</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Skup suglasnika sp se izgovara kao šp: spielen (pljune).</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Glagol tun u se izgovara svim osobama.</div></div> </div> </details> <details class=\"lesson1-accordion\"> <summary><span class=\"lesson1-number lesson1-number-blue\">4.</span><span>Gramatika</span><span class=\"lesson1-chevron\">⌄</span></summary> <div class=\"lesson1-content lesson1-grammar-content\"> <section class=\"lesson1-block\"> <h4 class=\"lesson1-grammar-header\"><span>1</span>Završetak sa e</h4> <div class=\"lesson1-grammar-note\">Ako se osnova glagola na t, d, chn, tada e stoji ispred završetaka -st i -t pri konjugaciji.</div> <h5 class=\"lesson2-subtitle\">arbeiten</h5> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"course-example\">ich arbeite</div><div class=\"course-example\">du arbeite</div><div class=\"course-example\">er arbeit</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie arbeite</div><div class=\"course-example\">du arbeite</div><div class=\"course-example\">er arbeit</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie arbeite</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie arbeite> arbeiten</div><div class=\"course-example\">ihr arbeit</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie arbeiten</div></div> <h5 class=\"lesson2-subtitle\">rechnen</h5> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"course-example\">ich rechne</div><div class=\"course-example\">du rechnest</div><div class=\"course-example\">er rechnet</div><div class=\"course-example\">div rechnet</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie ><div class=\"course-example\">sie rechnest</div><div class=\"course-example\">er rechnet</div><div class=\"course-example\">div rechnet> rechnen</div><div class=\"course-example\">ihr rechnet</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie rechnen</div></div> <h5 class=\"lesson2-subtitle\">vi</h5> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"course-example\">ich tue</div><div class=\"course-example\">du tust</div><div class=\"course-example\">er tut</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie tut</div><div class=\"course-example\">du tust</div><div class=\"course-example\">er tut</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie tut=\"amplecours\"><div tut =</div><div class=\"course-example\"> tun</div><div class=\"course-example\">ihr tut</div><div class=\"course-example\">sie tun</div></div> </section> <section class=\"lesson1-block\"> <h4 class=\"lesson1-grammar-header\"><span>2</span>Upitna riče</h4> <div class=\"lesson1-grammar-note\">U upitnim rečenicama koje počinju upitnom riječi, na primjer: šta? sta? SZO? zašto? zašto? itd., glagol comeživi izmo iza upitne riječi.</div> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"course-example\">Was tust du? - Šta radiš?</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Bio je tut er? - Šta on radi?</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Was tut sie? \"Šta ona radi?\"</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Je li tun sie? — Šta oni rade?</div></div> </section> <section class=\"lesson1-block\"> <h4 class=\"lesson1-grammar-header\"><span>3</span>Negacija s nichtom</h4> <div class=\"lesson1-grammar-note\">Ako se negacija nicht odnosi na glagol, onda negirana rije stoji iza glagola.</div> <div class=\"lesson1-card-grid\"><div class=\"course-example\">Er kommt nicht. - Ne dolaze.</div><div class=\"<div class=\"kurss-example\">Ne pjevaju. - Ne pevaju.</div></div> </section> </div> </details> <details class=\"lesson1-accordion\"> <summary><span class=\"lesson1-number lesson1-number-orange\">5.</span><span>Prevedi</span><span class=\"lesson1-chevron\">⌄</span></summary> <div class=\"lesson1-content\"> <div class=\"lesson1-training-wrap\"> <button class=\"lesson1-training-flashcard\" type=\"button\" data-lesson2-training-card data-training-index=\"0\" data-showing-back=\"false\" aria-label=\"Prevodna kartica 2. lekcije\"> <span class=\"lesson1-training-progress\">Predavanje 2 · Preveo: 1 / 15</span> <span class=\"lesson1-training-text\">Kakva pita?</span> </button> <p class=\"lesson1-training-hint\">Kliknite na karticu da vidite njemački prijevod. Nakon odgovora, sljedeći klik prikazuje sljedeću karticu.</p> </div> </div> </details>"
